title: "HODGE — Lean 4 skeleton of the Hodge conjecture"
message: "Cite this repository as a formal skeleton, not as a proof of the Hodge conjecture."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Frohman
    given-names: Benjamin Stanley
    alias: "@BenFrohman"
