date-released: "2026-09-21"
abstract: >
  Lean 4 encoding of the Hodge sentence for fourfolds and classical island
  constructions. Does not prove the Hodge conjecture.
keywords:
  - Hodge conjecture
  - Lean 4
  - algebraic geometry
